WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Visual description; no audio] ROB holds a red Coke can in front of its chest. The opposite gripper is open.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The torso turns above the tracked base while the gripper keeps hold of the can.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
ROB holds the turned position with the can still extended in its gripper.
